Package: lassoboot
Title: Parametric Bootstrap for Lasso Regression with Measurement Uncertainty
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("DoctorBear-it", email = "barrett310@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tidy parametric bootstrap for lasso regression in the presence of
    measurement uncertainty. Accepts tidy data frames, a declarative uncertainty
    specification, derived-quantity definitions, and per-column constraints;
    returns selection probabilities, stability scores, and bootstrap confidence
    intervals compatible with dplyr, ggplot2, and broom.
